%!PS
% Adds the Associated Files array to the Catalog for Ghostscript before 10.04.0.
%
% PDF/A-3 requires /AF in the Catalog for an embedded file, ISO 19005-3,
% clause 6.8. zugferd.ps no longer adds it, because Ghostscript 10.04.0 and
% later emit it themselves. Older versions emit nothing, so validators reject
% the output.
%
% Ghostscript runs this file after zugferd.ps. Named pdfmark objects live for
% the whole run, so {AFArray} from zugferd.ps is still defined here. The guards
% mirror zugferd.ps: without the XML file or the ICC profile it creates no
% {AFArray}.
/ZUGFeRDXMLFile where {
  pop
  /ZUGFeRDProfile where {
    pop
    revision 10040 lt {
      [ {Catalog} << /AF {AFArray} >> /PUT pdfmark
    } if
  } if
} if
